    <string name="find_gauge_desc">Signal %1$d out of 100, %2$s</string>
    <string name="find_tips">Walk slowly and hold the phone the same way. Stop for a few seconds after each step: the number jumps around, so follow the trend. Your body blocks the signal, so turn around too. Above 80, check bags, pockets, car seats, under bumpers and inside wheel wells.</string>
